00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:10,501
Search Event Log by normalized Vehicle ID and open Multi-Pass Vehicle Comparison.

2
00:00:10,541 --> 00:00:20,943
Expand Alarm Category Co-Occurrence (UpSet) and filter Event Log by a populated main category.

3
